---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="VisaOS | Official U.S. Visa Information Starting Points"
  description="Find independent navigation to official U.S. visitor visa, DS-160, wait-time and application-problem resources without outcome promises."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Independent U.S. visa knowledge</div>
      <h1>Understand your visa journey.<br />Find your next step.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Clear navigation to verified official U.S. visa resources. Built to help applicants find
        reliable information—not promise visa outcomes.
      </p>
      <a href="/us/">Explore official starting points →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:36px;padding-bottom:48px">
    <h2>Start with your question</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="panel">
        <span class="pill">Official sources</span>
        <h3>U.S. visa starting points</h3>
        <p>Find Department of State resources for visitor visas, the DS-160 and wait times.</p>
        <a href="/us/">Open the U.S. visa hub →</a>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <span class="pill">Troubleshooting</span>
        <h3>Visa application problems</h3>
        <p>Identify the relevant official source for common application and scheduling issues.</p>
        <a href="/us/problems/">Explore troubleshooting →</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
